WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.270
I can hardly believe I'm here

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.650
My name is Terence McKenna and

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:26.000
my training is basically in shamanism and botany

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.700
and ethnography. Well until a few minutes ago I thought that this was a 45 minute gig, so...

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.430
you get to see grace under pressure this
evening

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:42.050
actually I'm kidding it doesn't matter
how long it goes

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:47.050
we could never get to the bottom of
this stuff

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:52.000
nor would we wish to, I think

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.230
you know one of the things that has
amazed me

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:02.250
with my own personal career

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.330
because you know I started out basically
shoveling snow

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:09.780
in a cowntown in Colorado and by

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:12.930
faith or who knows what

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:16.820
come to the present position

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.880
and what I notice as I

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:25.320
traverse levels on a supposed ladder of success

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:28.360
where you would expect

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.380
there to be more and more competition
and

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:34.430
people and activity.. actually it gets

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:37.430
emptier and emptier 

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:42.180
there is nobody minding the store as far as I can tell

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.550
this is why I'm so unsympathetic

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:49.759
to conspiracy theory, we could use a few

00:01:49.759 --> 00:01:53.900
conspiracies, nobody is minding the store

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.780
everybody is getting rich

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.000
personally rich

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:38.159
and so all this fantastic apparatus that we see around us is really

00:02:38.159 --> 00:02:42.269
not so much in the service of channeling liquids,

00:02:42.269 --> 00:02:43.739
gases,

00:02:43.739 --> 00:02:48.530
but in the service channeling spirit

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:52.000
and into the higher realms where it then can be

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:56.270
refluxed, recondensed and the

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.300
lapis philosophorum

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:03.800
the stone of the philosophers, the central mystery, brought to completion

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:17.560
it is upon us

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:21.870
every messiah, every religious ontology, 

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.420
every manager

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:28.530
of every booth at this exhibit

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:34.700
is reflecting a distorted scintilla

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:40.250
of the spiritual reality of the transcendental object at the end of time

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:43.560
everyone of us is a particularized

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:47.200
and distorted image of this

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.000
transcendental object, into which

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.200
we are being dissolved

00:04:16.109 --> 00:04:16.830
so,

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:19.300
uh..

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:24.600
well, so what?

